    "verdict": {
      "html": "<div class=\"verdict\"><div class=\"pct warn\">+0%</div>\n     <div><p class=\"call\">Na média. Serve até aparecer um melhor.</p><p class=\"muted\" style=\"color:var(--ink-2)\">SpATK do seu contra um Mewtwo médio no mesmo nível. É o stat que define o dano dele.</p></div></div>\n   <div class=\"trio\"><div><small>Resistência vs médio</small><b>+0%</b></div><div><small>SpATK do máximo possível</small><b>58%</b></div><div><small>HP de combate</small><b>7.248</b></div></div>"
    },
    "stats": {
      "html": "<div class=\"radar-wrap\"><svg class=\"radar\" viewBox=\"0 0 300 280\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Radar dos stats contra o máximo\"><defs><linearGradient id=\"rg\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\"><stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"var(--t1)\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"var(--t2)\"/></linearGradient></defs>\n    <polygon points=\"150,30 245.26279441628824,85 245.26279441628827,194.99999999999997 150,250 54.73720558371177,195.00000000000003 54.737205583711756,84.99999999999999\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--hair-2)\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><polygon points=\"150,57.5 221.4470958122162,98.75 221.4470958122162,181.25 150,222.5 78.55290418778382,181.25000000000003 78.55290418778381,98.74999999999999\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--hair-2)\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><polygon points=\"150,85 197.6313972081441,112.5 197.63139720814414,167.5 150,195 102.36860279185589,167.50000000000003 102.36860279185588,112.5\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--hair-2)\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><polygon points=\"150,112.5 173.81569860407205,126.25 173.81569860407205,153.75 150,167.5 126.18430139592795,153.75 126.18430139592795,126.25\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--hair-2)\" stroke-width=\"1\"/>\n    <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"30\" stroke=\"var(--hair)\"/><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"245.26279441628824\" y2=\"85\" stroke=\"var(--hair)\"/><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"245.26279441628827\" y2=\"194.99999999999997\" stroke=\"var(--hair)\"/><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"250\" stroke=\"var(--hair)\"/><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"54.73720558371177\" y2=\"195.00000000000003\" stroke=\"var(--hair)\"/><line x1=\"150\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"54.737205583711756\" y2=\"84.99999999999999\" stroke=\"var(--hair)\"/>\n    <polygon points=\"150.0,84.1 202.4,109.7 200.9,169.4 150.0,203.3 99.1,169.4 100.2,111.2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--ink-2)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\"/>\n    <polygon points=\"150.0,84.1 202.4,109.7 200.9,169.4 150.0,203.3 99.1,169.4 100.2,111.2\" fill=\"url(#rg)\" fill-opacity=\".45\" stroke=\"url(#rg)\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/>\n    <text x=\"150\" y=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"\">HP</text><text x=\"264.3153532995459\" y=\"78\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"\">ATK</text><text x=\"264.3153532995459\" y=\"209.99999999999997\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"\">DEF</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"276\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"k\">SpATK</text><text x=\"35.684646700454124\" y=\"210.00000000000006\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"\">SpDEF</text><text x=\"35.68464670045411\" y=\"77.99999999999999\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"\">SPD</text></svg><div class=\"stats\"><div class=\"st\"><span class=\"nm \">HP</span>\n    <div class=\"track\" aria-label=\"HP: seu 604, médio 604, máximo 1189\"><span class=\"fill\" style=\"width:43.26647564469914%\"></span><span class=\"avg\" style=\"left:43.26647564469914%\"></span><span class=\"top\" style=\"left:calc(85.17191977077364% - 2px)\"></span></div>\n    <span class=\"v\">604</span></div><div class=\"st\"><span class=\"nm \">ATK</span>\n    <div class=\"track\" aria-label=\"ATK: seu 613, médio 613, máximo 1114\"><span class=\"fill\" style=\"width:43.911174785100286%\"></span><span class=\"avg\" style=\"left:43.911174785100286%\"></span><span class=\"top\" style=\"left:calc(79.79942693409743% - 2px)\"></span></div>\n    <span class=\"v\">613</span></div><div class=\"st\"><span class=\"nm \">DEF</span>\n    <div class=\"track\" aria-label=\"DEF: seu 527, médio 527, máximo 986\"><span class=\"fill\" style=\"width:37.750716332378225%\"></span><span class=\"avg\" style=\"left:37.750716332378225%\"></span><span class=\"top\" style=\"left:calc(70.63037249283667% - 2px)\"></span></div>\n    <span class=\"v\">527</span></div><div class=\"st\"><span class=\"nm key\">SpATK</span>\n    <div class=\"track\" aria-label=\"SpATK: seu 803, médio 803, máximo 1396\"><span class=\"fill\" style=\"width:57.5214899713467%\"></span><span class=\"avg\" style=\"left:57.5214899713467%\"></span><span class=\"top\" style=\"left:calc(100% - 2px)\"></span></div>\n    <span class=\"v\">803</span></div><div class=\"st\"><span class=\"nm \">SpDEF</span>\n    <div class=\"track\" aria-label=\"SpDEF: seu 527, médio 527, máximo 986\"><span class=\"fill\" style=\"width:37.750716332378225%\"></span><span class=\"avg\" style=\"left:37.750716332378225%\"></span><span class=\"top\" style=\"left:calc(70.63037249283667% - 2px)\"></span></div>\n    <span class=\"v\">527</span></div><div class=\"st\"><span class=\"nm \">SPD</span>\n    <div class=\"track\" aria-label=\"SPD: seu 709, médio 709, máximo 1356\"><span class=\"fill\" style=\"width:50.787965616045845%\"></span><span class=\"avg\" style=\"left:50.787965616045845%\"></span><span class=\"top\" style=\"left:calc(97.13467048710602% - 2px)\"></span></div>\n    <span class=\"v\">709</span></div></div></div><p class=\"note\">Contorno tracejado no radar: exemplar médio. O ponto ao lado do nome marca o stat de ataque dele. Resistência é a média de HP, DEF e SpDEF contra o exemplar médio.</p>"
    },
    "imp": {
      "html": "<p style=\"margin:0\">Os golpes de dano dele são especiais: o <b>SpATK</b> (base 154) decide o dano. ATK só pesa na Investida, que é física.</p>\n   <div class=\"mins\">\n    <div><small>Qualidade mínima</small><b>1,3</b><span>sai em ~26% das capturas, cerca de 4</span></div>\n    <div><small>IV de SpATK</small><b>20+</b><span>a média é 16,5</span></div>\n    <div><small>IV de HP e DEF</small><b>16+</b><span>define quanto aguenta antes da poção</span></div>\n    <div><small>IV de SPD</small><b>livre</b><span>só encurta a recarga</span></div>\n   </div>\n   <div><b>Para comparar dois Mewtwo</b><ol class=\"prio\"><li>Maior qualidade.</li><li>Empate de qualidade (até 0,05): maior IV de SpATK.</li><li>Depois IV de HP e DEF.</li><li>P2 e P3 desempatam. P4, P5 ou shiny passam na frente de tudo.</li></ol></div>\n   <div class=\"mult\">\n    <div class=\"mlab\"><b>Bate forte</b><small>esses tipos apanham ×2+ dos golpes dele</small></div>\n    <div class=\"chips\"><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#b0483f\"><i></i>Lutador<em>×2</em></span><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#9a5c9a\"><i></i>Veneno<em>×2</em></span></div>\n    <div class=\"mlab\"><b>Sofre de</b><small>esses tipos batem ×2,5+ nele</small></div>\n    <div class=\"chips\"><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#98a83a\"><i></i>Inseto<em>×2,5</em></span><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#73659a\"><i></i>Fantasma<em>×2,5</em></span><span class=\"type\" style=\"--c:#6f6258\"><i></i>Sombrio<em>×2,5</em></span></div>\n   </div>"
    },
    "escada": {
      "html": "<p class=\"note\">Mewtwo não está no guia de evoluções da comunidade (só Kanto e algumas cadeias). </p>"
    },
    "hunt-lede": {
      "text": "60 hunts entre o Nv 60 e o Nv 110 simuladas com o seu exemplar. 58 são seguras (no pior intervalo de 5 s ele leva menos de 50% do HP). No topo ficam as que somam mais abates por hora em hunts de nível mais alto, que pagam mais."
    },
